/**
 * Seed script — idempotent. Run: `bun prisma/seed.ts`
 *
 * Fills: original tracks (generated by scripts/generate_music.py) and
 * sample anonymous posts + comments. Daily content needs NO seeding: the
 * Verse and Parable of the Day rotate deterministically through curated
 * Scripture banks (src/lib/daily.ts + src/lib/parables-bank.ts) — no AI,
 * no database rows involved.
 */
